  "description": "Dion has a secret lover—not in the waking world, but in his dreams. Every night, the visitor holds him and whispers lovingly into his ear; though the memories are hazy by the morning, the warmth of each embrace lingers. However, with the reality of marriage upon him, Dion decides to bid farewell to his imaginary lover. It's only a figment of his imagination, after all. But as misfortune starts to befall those around him, he realizes that there may be more to his dreams than he'd imagined...\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
